传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2f83c142b53ed7a6593","start":163,"end":175},{"id":"houzhu-q-O005","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-79ab2e26e514bf6b9ab6","layer":"original","quote":"建兴元年夏〖3〗，牂牁太守朱褒拥郡反〖4〗。﹝二﹞先是，益州郡有大姓雍闿反〖5〗，流太守张裔于吴〖6〗，据郡不宾〖7〗；越嶲夷王高定亦背叛〖8〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73},{"id":"houzhu-q-O011","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-354a0a35bf9887aa11d1","layer":"original","quote":"三年春三月，丞相亮南征四郡〖2〗，四郡皆平。改益州郡为建宁郡；分建宁、永昌郡为云南郡〖3〗；又分建宁、牂牁为兴古郡〖4〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61},{"id":"houzhu-q-O012","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-3529bcb2e8097984bcb5","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，亮还成都。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9},{"id":"huangli-q-3076eb64caa60a3cd72c","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"高定恣睢於越嶲","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":4,"end":11},{"id":"huangli-q-43a5e313e1c23bb63d00","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"亮至南，上表曰：“永昌郡吏吕凯、府丞王伉等，执忠绝域〖26〗，十有余年；雍闿、高定逼其东北，而凯等守义不与交通。臣不意永昌风俗敦直乃尔","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":110},{"id":"huangli-q-4639de401721810ce6f4","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"于是恢出击，大破之；追奔逐北，南至盘江〖19〗，东接牂牁，与亮声势相连","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":170,"end":205},{"id":"huangli-q-6468462c5c9ba31b69b4","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"丞相亮南征，先由越嶲","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":42},{"id":"huangli-q-719f26aa2be89e5fdfc4","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"及丞相亮南征讨阉，既发在道","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":31},{"id":"huangli-q-82cef6099d615e3317fb","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"雍闿跋扈於建宁","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":23},{"id":"huangli-q-8607804c6bf08d8f9001","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"而闿已为高定部曲所杀","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":42},{"id":"huangli-q-b5114bce442112fd9e76","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"时恢众少敌倍，又未得亮声息，绐谓南人曰〖15〗：“官军粮尽，欲规退还〖16〗；吾中间久斥乡里〖17〗，乃今得旋〖18〗，不能复北；欲还与汝等同计谋，故以诚相告。”南人信之，故围守怠缓","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":78,"end":169},{"id":"huangli-q-d6880fb35d8a8e416986","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"朱褒反叛于牂牁","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":31},{"id":"huangli-q-e1483ff918bac0db8db5","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-8de1f97850df61e22fd0","layer":"original","quote":"时雍闿等闻先主薨于永安，骄黠滋甚","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16},{"id":"huangli-q-e3ccf28eaf60b6787884","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-e11f9e586959d73e2f0d","layer":"original","quote":"而恢案道向建宁〖13〗，诸县大相纠合，围恢军于昆（明）〔泽〕","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":73},{"id":"huangli-q2-6254044d8d3612c9cdf7","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"凯威恩内著，为郡中所信，故能全其节。及丞相亮南征讨阉，既发在道，而闿已为高定部曲所杀。亮至南，上表曰：“永昌郡吏吕凯、府丞王伉等，执忠绝域〖26〗，十有余年；雍闿、高定逼其东北，而凯等守义不与交通。臣不意永昌风俗敦直乃尔！”","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":112},{"id":"huowang-q-8f424ee850969da203c7","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-5008b9b7cd23cd6b1641","layer":"original","quote":"丞相亮南征，朗留统后事","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":31},{"id":"huowang-q-9418f38e1a330c9a23fd","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-0331bba35be1e9a1beba","layer":"original","quote":"建兴三年，随诸葛亮南行，归至汉阳县","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17},{"id":"liuermu-q-74c22b7e2a9d68bbb6e6","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-2a7eb34fd683676ae1b4","layer":"original","quote":"丞相诸葛亮平南土","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":41,"end":49},{"id":"liuermu-q-a9f48e45367138fd4bf2","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-2a7eb34fd683676ae1b4","layer":"original","quote":"南中豪率雍闿据益郡反〖31〗，附于吴","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":3,"end":21},{"id":"liuliao-q-d30b577332683417501e","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-c85321149a539f796ae2","layer":"original","quote":"又越嶲夷率高定，遣军围新道县〖7〗；严驰往赴救，贼皆破走。加辅汉将军〖8〗，领郡如故。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":140,"end":183},{"id":"mingdi-q-p011","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c27aa797bbb589ad369a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《魏略》载帝露布天下并班告益州曰：“刘备背恩，自窜巴蜀；诸葛亮弃父母之国，阿残贼之党：神人被毒，恶积身灭。亮外慕立孤之名，而内贪专擅之实，刘升之兄弟守空城而已。亮又侮易益土，虐用其民；是以利狼、宕渠、高定、青羌莫不瓦解，为亮仇敌。而亮反裘负薪，里尽毛殚；刖趾适屦，刻肌伤骨；反更称说，自以为能；行兵于井底，游步于牛蹄。自朕即位，三边无事。犹哀怜天下数遭兵革，且欲养四海之耆老，长后生之孤幼；先移风于礼乐，次讲武于农隙；置亮画外，未以为虞。而亮怀李熊愚勇之志，不思荆邯度德之戒；驱略吏民，盗利祁山。王师方振，胆破气夺。马谡、高祥，望旗奔败；虎臣逐北，蹈尸涉血。亮也小子，震惊朕师；猛锐踊跃，咸思长驱。朕惟率土莫非王臣，师之所处，荆棘生焉；不欲使千室之邑忠信贞良，与夫淫昏之党共受涂炭。故先开示，以昭国诚；勉思变化，无滞乱邦。巴蜀将吏士民诸为亮所劫迫，公卿以下皆听束手。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f26a9020083ed68c5298","start":0,"end":387},{"id":"wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：黄初四年（公元 223）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":394,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2950ca88709b8c25fb44","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o038","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-62c39b4b73d5f8874468","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“丧乱以来，兵革未戢〖2〗。天下之人，互相残杀。今海内初定，敢有私复仇者，皆族之〖3〗！”筑南巡台于宛。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":391,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"zhuge-e-o022b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-cdc51ff4fdbd6022c499","layer":"original","quote":"南中诸郡，并皆叛乱。亮以新遭大丧，故未便加兵；且遣使聘吴，因结和亲〖8〗，遂为与国〖9〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":87},{"id":"zhuge-e-o023a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-862592827af5abe9feb3","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖10〗，亮率众南征〖11〗。﹝三﹞其秋，悉平：军资所出〖12〗，国以富饶；﹝四﹞乃治戎讲武，以俟大举。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":133,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-28bd067e0a3e898385bc","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-28bd067e0a3e898385bc","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗三年：建兴三年（公元 225）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-d52302c7e46aff00f085","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhuge-q-o021","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-6f9ad1f5d575a9d3f55f","layer":"original","quote":"章武三年春，先主于永安病笃〖1〗；召亮于成都，属以后事。谓亮曰：“君才十倍曹丕，必能安国，终定大事。若嗣子可辅，辅之；如其不才〖2〗，君可自取〖3〗。”亮涕泣曰：“臣敢竭股肱之力〖4〗，效忠贞之节，继之以死！”先主又为诏敕后主曰：“汝与丞相从事〖5〗，事之如父。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135},{"id":"zhuge-q-o023","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-862592827af5abe9feb3","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖10〗，亮率众南征〖11〗。﹝三﹞其秋，悉平：军资所出〖12〗，国以富饶；﹝四﹞乃治戎讲武，以俟大举。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":133,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
